requires overtime pay for Government employees.  When there is a need for special work periods, such in occupied 
family housing, modify this paragraph accordingly.</NPR><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<NPR>For MCBH Kaneohe Bay, use 30 calendar days in bracketed option.</NPR><BRK/>
<BRK/>
