or times.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT>No work may be performed during the period [_____] to [_____], inclusive, without prior written approval of the Contracting Officer.  This period 
has not been considered in computing the time allowed for the performance of this contract.</TXT><BRK/>
