<BRK/>
<OLI>Connection to Existing Sanitary Sewer Line:  Provide positive verification that the existing line conveys sanitary sewer; verify line is 
not incorrectly connected to a storm drain.[  Obtain Installation's Sanitary Sewer Connection Permit[ 2 weeks][ _____] prior to connection 
and in accordance with Section <SRF>33 30 00</SRF> SANITARY SEWERAGE.]</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/></TAI>
</OLG></SPT><TAI OPT="NAVY">[<SPT><TTL>Shipyard Area Work Clearance Request</TTL><BRK/>
<TAI OPT="NAVFAC HI"><NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
