<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT><TST>Coordinate excavation and electrical work, including testing and troubleshooting of circuits, within the NAVFAC Hawaii Utilities Management (UM) 
and PHNSY&amp;IMF via the Contracting Officer.</TST>  Furnish the:</TXT><BRK/>
