<BRK/>
[<TXT>The use of yellow, yellow-orange, red and magenta materials for the following purposes is prohibited: sheeting, tarpaulins, polyethylene bottles 
or other containers, tapes, bags, banding of identification marks on tools, and boundary markers such as ribbons.  Obtain Contracting Officer's 
prior approval for use of such colored materials for other purposes, such as buried vapor barrier membranes.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
]</TAI></SPT>]</TAI></SPT>[<SPT><TTL>SECURITY REQUIREMENTS</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
