]</SPT>]</SPT>]</TAI><TAI OPT="NAVFAC FE">[<SPT><TTL><SUB>TRANSPORTATION OF PERSONNEL, MATERIALS, AND EQUIPMENT</SUB> FOR WAKE AND DIEGO GARCIA</TTL><BRK/>
